WEBVTT

00:00:10,030 --> 00:00:19,030
Can we put infrared heating pad with castor oil pack on the left kidney where the tumor is or would that be harmful?

00:00:20,030 --> 00:00:30,030
No, I'd be careful putting a castor oil pack and a heating pad right over a cancer, you know, right over a tumor.

00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:33,030
I would, personally, I just would not do that.

00:00:33,030 --> 00:00:43,030
Oh, there's other practitioners say absolutely you want to get things moving there, but I mean, there's there's also a risk of I would not do that. What's the purpose of that?

00:00:43,030 --> 00:00:58,030
You want to, you want to use castor oil to help get things moving through your detox pathway. So to me, the best place for castor oil packs is over your liver.

00:00:58,030 --> 00:01:11,030
I talked to some of the other day that isn't patients that said they do castor oil packs all over their body. It's like, well, okay, I don't know who has time to do that. I don't ever recommend that.

00:01:11,030 --> 00:01:21,030
I know we've had discussions on this to do castor oil over abreast and such and I didn't necessarily recommend that but people said they had some success with it.

00:01:21,030 --> 00:01:27,030
Okay, well, sorry to argue with that, but just be careful putting it over the tumor.

